      "writtenOn": "2024-07-22T10:00:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, Do you mean upstream to kernel.org? Or you mean we have to directly cherry-pick the following patches: 1699785, 1745515, 1768667 with an \"UPSTREAM\" tag instead of creating a new patch? Thanks~",
      "parentUuid": "8acf42a6_905fc359",
      "revId": "af3789e3db1ae277d6083d8d2d88d25a1259a2db",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8e548ca9_55b8bba2",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
